ve;white-space: nowrap\">阿媽<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">아ˉ마`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">對<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뒤`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">上好<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">셩호`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ti-soè-han’e si-jūn gûn-ā-mà tùi-goà siong-hò\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    가<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">上好<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">셩호`</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">物件<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">밓걀ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby>에<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">留<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">ᄅᅷ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">허<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby>’꽈\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ka̰-siong-hò’e mih-kiā̰ lông-e-lau-hōr’goa\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">이<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby> 마<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">定定<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">댤댤-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">𤆬<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">촤-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">去<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">킈`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">유<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">치<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">엔<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ī ma-tia̰-tia̰-choa-goà khì-yū-chî-èn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">칟<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">토<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˏ</rt>