tyle=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇샬ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">阿媽<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">아ˉ마`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kôh-kiò-lì jit-siā̰-ā-mà\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<table class=\"wp-block-table alignleft\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;border: none;font-size: 14px\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td style=\"border: none;vertical-align: top;min-width: 5em;padding-right: 1.5em;padding-left: 0;padding-top: 0;padding-bottom: 0\">\n  <a href=\"#_ftnref1\" id=\"_ftn1\">¹</a>\n  <i>\n    <span style=\"display: inline-flex\">\n      <ruby style=\"position: relative\">유<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1em;left: 0.5em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">치<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1em;left: 0.5em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">엔<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1em;left: 0.5em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n  </i> :\n</td>\n    <td style=\"border: none;padding: 0\">\n      (中) 幼稚園（日文：<ruby style=\"position: relative\">幼稚園<rt style=\"font-size: 50%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 4px\">ようちえん</rt></ruby> yōchien）。<br>\n      (en) Kindergarten (Japanese: <ruby style=\"position: relative\">幼稚園<rt style=\"font-size: 50%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 4px\">ようちえん</rt></ruby> yōchien).\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<div style=\"clear: both;margin-bottom: 1em\"></div>\n"
